      "content": "i hear you, but honestly it just feels like i'm trapping them in a life they didn't choose. every time they help me, it feels like they're losing a piece of their own future. if i wasn't here, they could finally breathe and actually move forward without constantly looking back to see if i'm okay. part of me thinks it would be more kind to just stop being the problem.",
